                "comment": "Was a great professor who cared. At this level with the difficulty of courses it's important that the prof is looking out for you. I went to his office hours a few times, they were easy and informative. Heat transfer is hard at times and it's important to attend lectures to get the material, but he does a good job. +he brought donuts for the final!",
